REQUIRE one generated line and current section/symbol state
ENSURE state update, exact bytes/fixup, or a line-specific error
remove comment and surrounding whitespace; ignore an empty line
IF a label precedes the statement THEN
  validate its spelling and require no previous definition
  define it at the current section-relative offset
END IF
classify the remaining operation as directive or instruction
IF directive THEN
  validate all operands and update section, binding, alignment, or storage
ELSE
  validate operand classes and select a supported fixed-size form
  emit known bytes and retain symbolic fields as fixups
END IF

